    "stem": "Vihaan studies three pairs near a farm pond: rhizobium bacteria in pea-plant roots that help the plant get nitrogen while the bacteria get food; a fern growing on a mango trunk without harming the tree; and lice living on a buffalo and harming it.\n\nHow should he classify the three relationships?",
