    "options": {
      "A": "Pea plant and rhizobium: mutualism. Fern and mango: commensalism. Lice and buffalo: parasitism.",
      "B": "Pea plant and rhizobium: parasitism. Fern and mango: mutualism. Lice and buffalo: commensalism.",
      "C": "All three are mutualism because each pair lives close together.",
      "D": "Fern and mango: parasitism, because the fern sits on the mango."
